<item><title>BGIS - Supply and Delivery of Electric Scissor Lift – JLG 2030ES or Equivalent</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> BGIS is seeking quotations for the supply and delivery of one (1) electric scissor lift for use within a managed facility environment.<br /><br />Suppliers are invited to submit offers for a JLG 2030ES or equivalent model that meets the attached specification. Alternative brands and models will be considered where the supplier can demonstrate equivalent or superior performance, functionality and compliance.<br /><br />The quotation should include:<br /><br />Supply of one (1) electric scissor lift<br /><br />Delivery to a nominated metropolitan Sydney location<br /><br />Product specification and brochure<br /><br />Warranty details<br /><br />Delivery lead time<br /><br />Any applicable commissioning or handover requirements<br /><br />The attached specification forms the minimum technical requirement for this request.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> BGIS<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521302<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Material Handling & Lifting Equip, Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
