<item><title>CN-26958a EOI - ETI for Construction of Coomera Connector Stage 2 Pimpama to Coomera</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR) invites suitably prequalified contractors to submit an Expression of Interest (EOI) for the Early Tenderer Involvement (ETI) of the Coomera Connector Stage 2 – Pimpama to Coomera project.<br /><br />The project involves the delivery of a new section of the Coomera Connector between Yawalpah Road to Shipper Drive. <br /><br />Tender documentation is available only to contractors prequalified with TMR at R5, B4, F150+, A4 or higher.<br /><br /><br />Tenderers should note that the following requirements apply to this project:<br /><br />•	Building and Construction Code of Practice 2000 (Queensland Code)<br /><br />•	Queensland Charter for Local Content<br /><br />•	Australian Government Building and Construction Industry WHS Accreditation Scheme<br /><br />•	Queensland Procurement Policy (QPP) 2026<br /><br />To obtain access to the EOI documentation via QBuild (eTender), please contact Rosie Lonergan at projects.southcoast@tmr.qld.gov.au.<br /><br />Your email re...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-South Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Sep/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521214<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
