<item><title>Substation Battery Chargers</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Energy Queensland Limited (EQL) intends to conduct an open Request for Tender for the supply and delivery of Substation Battery Chargers. The tender will be released and managed through SAP Ariba.<br /><br />This notice is intended to identify suppliers interested in participating in the upcoming RFT and to facilitate supplier registration in EQL’s SAP Ariba environment. Registration of interest does not constitute prequalification, create any commitment by EQL, or guarantee that a supplier will be invited to participate in or awarded any contract arising from the RFT.<br /><br />SCOPE: <br /><br />The proposed scope covers the supply and delivery of stationary DC battery chargers and associated equipment for use across EQL’s substation network. The detailed technical requirements and proposed equipment configurations are set out in the attached EQL Technical Specification for Substation DC Battery Chargers, S10034540.<br /><br />Substation battery chargers are critical assets that maintain station batteries ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Energy Queensland Limited<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521189<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Power Generation, Trans & Distrib.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
