<item><title>Talwood WTP Booster Pump Building</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council (GRC) has identified the requirement for the Supply and Installation of a new building to house the Talwood Town Water Supply Booster Pumps.<br /><br />Supply & installation of a complete booster pump building, including all associated structural, architectural, and installation works necessary to provide a durable, secure, and fit-for-purpose enclosure for the town water supply booster pumps, including the installation, connection, and integration of the Goondiwindi Regional Council supplied booster pump skid into the existing town water supply system.<br /><br />The respondent shall nominate their proposed Available Start Date and Expected Completion Date<br /><br />The town of Talwood is located approximately 439km West South-West of Brisbane in Southern Queensland.<br /><br />The Talwood Water Treatment Plant is located at 41 Recreation St, Talwood.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Sep/2026 09:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521122<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
