</item>
<item><title>C26-148 Supply Panel Heating, Ventilation &amp; Air Conditioning (HVAC) Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council seeks to establish a panel of suitably qualified and experienced contractors to provide HVAC maintenance, repair, emergency response, minor renewal works and associated specialist services across Council-owned and managed facilities.<br /><br />The panel will provide services on an as-required basis for a diverse portfolio of buildings including:<br /><br />•	Offices and administration buildings <br /><br />•	Community centres <br /><br />•	Libraries <br /><br />•	Kindergartens and childcare facilities <br /><br />•	Sporting pavilions <br /><br />•	Aquatic facilities <br /><br />•	Public amenities <br /><br />•	Depots and workshops <br /><br />•	Heritage buildings<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Macedon Ranges Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520968<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Gas Energy, Infrastructure, Equipment, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
