<item><title>QPWS Fire Protective Clothing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of the Environment, Tourism, Science and Innovation invites Offers from Suppliers for Invitation to Offer (ITO) No. P253557 for the provision of Queensland Parks and Wildlife Services (QPWS) Fire Protective Clothing.<br /><br />The scope of this ITO focusses on the supply of fire Personal Protective Clothing (PPC) across the State including jackets, trousers and shirts produced in accordance with Part B: Contract Details, Attachment 1 - QPWS Fire Protective Clothing Specifications for issue to fire trained staff and required to be worn by personnel when undertaking fire operations including planned burns and wildfire response.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Dept of the Environ, Tourism, Science and Innov<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520788<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Clothing & Safety Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
