<item><title>IRC-E&amp;I-0225-T414 V2 Nebo Administrative Building Roof Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Isaac Regional Council invites tenderers to submit pricing for the replacement of the existing roof at the Nebo Administrative Building which includes the Hub, office spaces and the Community Hall. Nebo is located 95km southwest of Mackay, and supports a community of farming and mining, boasting many historical landmarks. Isaac Regional Council Nebo Administrative Building serves as the administration base for Isaac Regional Council, facilitating the link between Council and the Nebo Community.<br /><br />Mandatory Site meeting 20 August 2026, see tender documents for further information. <br /><br />Tender Closes 2pm Thursday 3 September 2026. <br /><br />Kind Regards, <br /><br />Isaac Regional Council<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Isaac Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520895<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
