<item><title>2026.049 Springs Road East Upgrade Construction Project -- REOI Stage 1 of 2</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mount Barker District Council (the Council) invites Expressions of Interest from Registrants for the provision of construction upgrade works at Springs Road East, Mount Barker.<br /><br />The works will comprise an upgrade to a 1 kilometre stretch of Springs Road East including asset renewal, road widening, stormwater drainage, lighting and landscaping. There is also an existing bridge midway along the road which needs widening to incorporate a footpath, wider traffic lanes and cycle lanes.<br /><br />This expression of interest is stage 1 of a 2 stage procurement process, with shortlisted tenderers from this stage progressing to the tender stage for construction.<br /><br />Details of the project are contained in the attached documents, together with the 70% design drawings to assist tenderers in understanding the project requirements.<br /><br />Any enquiries relating to this project or documents enclosed, must be submitted by vendorpanel and a response will be provided.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mount Barker District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Sep/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520810<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
