<item><title>LG314/1076/26/020 – Expression of Interest for Design and Construction of PCYC at Pimpama</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Gold Coast invites Expressions of Interest from suitably experienced and capable head contractors for the design and construction of a new two-level PCYC youth, community, sport and recreation facility at Pimpama Village Park North.<br /><br />The EOI is the first stage of a two-stage procurement process and will be used to establish a shortlist for a subsequent Select Tender. The City's current preference is to shortlist approximately three Respondents.<br /><br />The EOI is focused on contractor capability, key personnel, project and program appreciation, and local benefits. <br /><br />The estimated construction budget is approximately $22 million. The proposed delivery model is Design and Construct.<br /><br />The proposed Select Tender Contract Header and amended AS4300 Conditions are also included with the EOI to allow early review of the proposed contractual position.<br /><br />Full requirements, conditions and response forms are available through VendorPanel.<br /><br />All enquiries and ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City Of Gold Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520621<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Matt Farrow Email: mafarrow@goldcoast.qld.gov.au Tel: 0402883259<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
