<item><title>25 26 496 Ballarat Regional Landfill Operational Services (EOI)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Ballarat seeks to engage a suitably qualified and experienced Contractor to undertake the day-to-day operation and management of the Ballarat Regional Landfill.<br /><br />The Contractor will be responsible for the safe, efficient, and compliant operation of the Ballarat Regional Landfill in accordance with EPA Victoria licence requirements and relevant legislation.<br /><br />Key services include:<br /><br />Landfill operations: Waste acceptance, inspection, placement, compaction, and daily cover application.<br /><br />Environmental management: Control of litter, dust, odour, noise, stormwater, leachate, and landfill gas systems.<br /><br />Compliance and reporting: Record keeping, monitoring, and reporting to meet EPA and Council requirements.<br /><br />Plant and workforce: Provision and maintenance of suitable plant, equipment, and trained personnel.<br /><br />Health and safety: Implementation of site safety systems and incident management.<br /><br />Site maintenance: Upkeep of roads, drain...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Ballarat<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520473<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
