<item><title>CQURFQ-26-35-DFM - ROK Road and Carpark Repairs</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The works comprise construct-only activities for the preparation and repaving of existing bitumen roadways and car parking areas within the CQUniversity North Rockhampton campus.<br /><br />The scope also includes upgrades to existing car park lighting infrastructure where assets have been identified as failing.<br /><br />The objective of the works is to reinstate surface condition, structural integrity, safety, and ride quality in accordance with the Principal’s requirements. <br /><br />The works are divided into Five (5) separable portions and are to be executed in a professional manner consistent with industry best practice and all applicable Australian Standards, unless otherwise noted.<br /><br />Separable portion 1 – Darambal Rd, Round-about<br /><br />Separable Portion 2 - Kidston Drive, Southbound side of the road<br /><br />Separable Portion 3 - Founders Drive at University Drive intersection<br /><br />Separable Portion 4 – Carpark 8 (CP8) Solar lighting <br /><br />Separable Portion 5 – Carpark 8...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Queensland University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519791<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
