<item><title>Camberwell Mural Festival - Creative Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Boroondara is seeking creative services to support the safe and successful delivery of creative services for Camberwell Mural Festival. <br /><br />Council invites submissions from applicants with demonstrated experience working with mural artists, coordinating public art projects, managing artist delivery and supporting precinct-based cultural activation. The project will create 8 to 12 high-quality murals, supported by live painting and associated public programming.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Boroondara<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520151<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Aisha Warsame Email: aisha.warsame@boroondara.vic.gov.au Tel: 9278 4329<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Graphical, Photographic & Art<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
