<item><title>ITT2560 - Servicing and Maintenance of Leachate and Sewerage Pumps</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited for routine maintenance services of Council’s leachate and sewerage pumps and stations.<br /><br />This contract is structured into two (2) Separable Portions:<br /><br />- Separable Portion A – Landfill Sites<br /><br />- Separable Portion B – Other Sites.<br /><br />Respondents may submit tenders for one (1) or both Separable Portions. Each portion has their own Technical Specification.<br /><br />Separable Portion A – Landfill Sites - Routine services are required to various types of pumping systems on a quarterly, annual, and three (3) yearly frequency at the following four (4) landfill sites:<br /><br />- Nambour Landfill<br /><br />- Caloundra Landfill<br /><br />- Buderim Resource Recovery Centre<br /><br />- Coolum Closed Landfill<br /><br />Separable Portion B – Other Sites<br /><br />This portion requires various Sewerage Pump Stations, Sump Pumps, Submersible Pumps and Water Filtration System services on monthly, quarterly, six monthly frequencies.<br /><br />Annual mechanical a...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520115<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
