<item><title>ITT2569 - Commercial Lease - 6-8 Omrah Avenue Caloundra</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited for the lease of the former Caloundra Library complex located at 6-8 Omrah Avenue Caloundra. <br /><br />The subject property comprises two (2 separate) buildings<br /><br />?	Tenancy 1 - 6 Omrah Avenue – 134sqm internal lettable areas*<br /><br />?	Tenancy 2 – 8 Omrah Avenue - 954qm internal lettable area*<br /><br />?	Combined Tenancy- 6-8 Omrah Avenue - 1088sqm internal lettable area*<br /><br />The entire lease area comprises approximately 2800m and is situated in the heart of the Caloundra CBD, with proximity to surrounding community infrastructure and services.<br /><br />The property is in a ready state for occupation and is offered as a warm shell.<br /><br />Council’s preferred leasing outcoming is a combined tenancy comprising Tenancy 1 and Tenancy 2. <br /><br />Notwithstanding this preference, Council will accept submissions for either individual tenancy.<br /><br />Council reserves the right to award one or both tenancies to one or more Respondents.:<br /><br />Following selec...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520121<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Management Advisory Services, Real Estate & Property Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
