<item><title>ITT2522 - Stormwater Upgrades - Sunshine Coast Stadium North, Bokarina - Stage 1A</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This project includes removal of the existing trunk line and installation of the new reinforced concrete box culverts and stormwater infrastructure, it will involve some disruption to businesses on Trade Lane and will require the contractor to manage Traffic and pedestrians in a live environment. There will be some access constraints due to Stadium events, and this will need to be built into the Contractors program.<br /><br />Works will include but not be limited to the following:<br /><br />•	Dewatering<br /><br />•	Acid sulphate soil management<br /><br />•	Groundwater control<br /><br />•	Access chamber construction<br /><br />•	Lake Kawana outlet works<br /><br />•	Installation of upgraded stormwater infrastructure<br /><br />•	Reconstruction of revetment walls - reference IFC Drawings<br /><br />•	Trade Lane reinstatement<br /><br />•	Sportsman Parade reinstatement<br /><br />•	Sewer realignment and replacement<br /><br />•	Temporary relocation of the pontoon<br /><br />•	Site demobilisation and project...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520107<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 34]]></description>
