<item><title>ROI: QED 5184 2026 Shailer Park SHS - MPH - Registration of Interest (PQC eligible contractors)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> As a Government Election Commitment (GEC), a new Double Court Multipurpose Hall is to be constructed at Shailer Park State High School. The new facility will make allowance for two multi-sport playing courts, associated facilities, staff offices, parking and two external tennis courts.<br /><br />This ROI seeks to gauge market interest from suitably prequalified contractors with a strong track record delivering comparable projects under similar conditions. The Department will use your response to develop a shortlist of tendering businesses.<br /><br />Please note that this is a PQC project and prospective tenderers will be required to satisfy the following parameters in order to be shortlisted for tendering:<br /><br />Areas of Operation/Office Location	Brisbane<br /><br />Service Category - New Construction work/Addition<br /><br />Service Activity - General Building – Medium<br /><br />Contract Category -	Design & Construct – Single Stage<br /><br />Project Type - Education - Schools<br /><br />Certificatio...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Education<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520306<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
