<item><title>Performance Health Practitioner Services (Medicine) - Brisbane</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> QAS is seeking one qualified Sport and Exercise Physician / Registrar to provide clinical care to QAS Athletes. The role is based in Brisbane, with services delivered primarily from QSAC and other training facilities. <br /><br />The role requires a commitment equivalent to one day per week, which may be scheduled flexibly to meet program and athlete requirements. Services are generally required over 48 weeks per 12-month period. <br /><br />The proposed contract is for an initial term from September 2026 to 25 Feb 2029.<br /><br />Responses are sought from individual practitioner/s who have the appropriate qualifications, experience, expertise and capacity to provide the required services.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Academy of Sport<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520232<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
