<item><title>Provision of Cleaning Services for Bribie Island Research Facility</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Primary Industries (DPI), through Research Infrastructure, requires the provision of cleaning services for Bribie Island Research Facility. <br /><br />Cleaning tasks are completed on a scheduled basis, ranging from daily cleaning tasks to annual and on-demand activities. Tasks undertaken are grouped into five service categories: <br /><br />1.	Flooring,<br /><br />2.	Window Glass, Sills & Internal Walls, Ceilings <br /><br />3.	Toilets, washrooms, showers and locker rooms,<br /><br />4.	Kitchen and breakout areas, and<br /><br />5.	Office areas, hallways, lab rooms and furniture <br /><br />The Supplier will be required to supply the required consumables, plant and equipment to undertake the services. The initial contract term is till 31 October 2027; with two (2) 12-month extension options. The complete contract requirements are specified in Schedule 1 of the attached ‘Contract Details’.<br /><br />This RFQ has a mandatory industry briefing on 9:00am AEST Tuesday, 18 August 2026. Suppliers...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Primary Industries<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520215<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
