<item><title>102.2026.9 Design of New Hughenden Water Treatment Plant</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> DESIGN OF NEW HUGHENDEN WATER TREATMENT PLANT<br /><br />Flinders Shire Council invites Tenders from suitably qualified Tenderers for the design of the proposed Hughenden Water Treatment Plant as described in more detail in Part 5 – Scope. The Principal wishes to procure the water treatment plant as soon as practicable, and an efficient but robust design process should be undertaken. The design consultant will need to undertake and complete documentation for construct only, and design and construct contracts, to fit the Principal’s procurement plan in consultation with the Principal.<br /><br />Tenderers are advised that, unless Council determines otherwise in its absolute discretion, the successful tenderer will not be permitted to provide services in connection with any further packages of work or services associated with this project (whether directly to Council or as a subconsultant to any other party).<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Flinders Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520131<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
