<item><title>EOI - Design, Installation, Operation and Maintenance of Public Electric Vehicle Charging Spaces</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council seeks proposals that support the strategic objectives of increasing EV charging availability, encouraging investment in sustainable transport infrastructure, and enhancing services for residents, businesses and visitors. The objectives of this EOI are to: • Deliver reliable, publicly accessible EV fast charging infrastructure. • Support Council's transition to an electric vehicle fleet. • Encourage tourism and local economic activity. • Minimise Council's capital and operational costs through a sustainable commercial model.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Muswellbrook Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520125<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Electronic Components & Supplies, Fleet Servicing & Accessories, Power Generation, Trans & Distrib., Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
