<item><title>Electrical Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Town of Gawler (the Council) invites submissions from Respondents for the provision of general electrical services across Council owned assets and facilities. <br /><br />This tender is for the establishment of a panel arrangement, and inclusion on the panel does not constitute a guarantee of any work, services, or contract value.<br /><br />Response Checklist:<br /><br />Please complete and upload to VendorPanel the following documents:<br /><br />1. Response Schedules document<br /><br />2. Attachment 2 Pricing Schedule <br /><br />3. Any other relevant information (i.e. insurance certificates, WHS policies, etc.)<br /><br />The Draft Services Agreement is provided for review of the proposed contract terms and conditions only and is not required to be completed or returned as part of the submission.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Gawler<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520118<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Shannon Smith Email: shannon.smith@gawler.sa.gov.au Tel: 8522 0110<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
