<item><title>Pinjarra Park Redevelopment Project - Architectural, Planning and Design Consultancy Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Pinjarra Racing Club Inc. is seeking to appoint a suitably qualified and experienced lead architectural consultant to provide Architectural, Planning and Design Consultancy Services for the Pinjarra Park Redevelopment Project.<br /><br />The successful consultant will be responsible for the planning, design, multidisciplinary consultant coordination, statutory approvals, detailed design, procurement support and construction phase services for the redevelopment of Pinjarra Park.<br /><br />The Project comprises two separable portions:<br /><br />1. Separable Portion 1: Industry, Jockey and Club Administration Building.<br /><br />2. Separable Portion 2: Viewing Pavilion.<br /><br />The Consultant is to complete the design and documentation for both separable portions, with the Principal retaining the option to proceed with either Separable Portion 1 only or both portions concurrently, depending on available funding.<br /><br />The services will be delivered primarily at Pinjarra Park, Racecourse Road, Pinjarra...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Pinjarra Racing Club<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Sep/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520069<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
