<item><title>Construction Material Management, including Beneficial Reuse or Recycling of Earthen Materials</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Principal requires the Services of one or more appropriately licenced and/or authorised, construction material management Contractors for the management of dredged and/or excavated non contaminated material (nonconmat) and contaminated materials (conmat) and greenwaste. <br /><br />Management may include the receiving, temporarily storing, recycling, reprocessing, treatment, buyback or disposal of the materials accepted. <br /><br />Please refer to the attached Tender documents for full details of the opportunity.<br /><br />Important: Suppliers must complete the Tender documents and submit their response via VendorPanel by the closing date and time. Responses that do not include completed Tender documents may not be considered. Email submissions will not be accepted.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City Of Gold Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Aug/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519637<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
