<item><title>T26/24 - Security Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The scope for this request forms part of a broader Council-wide procurement plan. Other directorates may elect to participate in this contract, and additional sites or service requirements may be incorporated through the contract and procurement team.<br /><br />This scope of services will contribute towards establishment of a Council-wide security service to support:<br /><br />•	Protection of Council assets and infrastructure<br /><br />•	Safety of staff, contractors and the public<br /><br />•	Reduction of theft, vandalism and unauthorised access<br /><br />•	Improved perception of safety across public spaces<br /><br />•	Compliance with regulatory and operational requirements<br /><br />This service scope applies across the directorate of Water, Waste and Open Spaces and covers the following areas:<br /><br />•	Open Spaces<br /><br />•	Lismore CBD (Law Enforcement / Rangers interface)<br /><br />•	Water, Wastewater and Buildings<br /><br />•	Waste Facilities<br /><br />•	Lismore Transit Centre<br /><br />...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Lismore City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519854<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
