<category>Training &amp; Development</category>
</item>
<item><title>Kundabung Feasibility Study</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this study is to assess the rural area of Kundabung, within Kempsey Shire NSW for potential future development. Council wish to understand if there is a convincing case for future development through exploring both demand and potential, by evaluating if and what market demand actually exists, the regulatory constraints, current infrastructure and costs.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Kempsey Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519776<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Management Advisory Services, Real Estate & Property Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
