<item><title>Expression of Interest - Caterpillar 793F Component Supply</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Bloomfield Group invites Expressions of Interest from suitably qualified suppliers for the provision of major components for its Caterpillar 793F haul trucks.<br /><br />The Caterpillar 793F fleet operates at Rix’s Creek Mine in the Hunter Valley, New South Wales. The trucks operate in an active open-cut mining environment and form part of the site’s production fleet.<br /><br />The Bloomfield Group is undertaking a first-life rebuild program to restore selected trucks to a defined operational standard, extend their service life and support ongoing fleet reliability and availability. <br /><br />As part of the broader rebuild strategy, The Bloomfield Group is considering both:<br /><br />•	an integrated delivery model, under which a single supplier provides a complete rebuild solution; and <br /><br />•	a disaggregated delivery model, under which component supply and rebuild activities are undertaken by multiple specialist suppliers. <br /><br />This EOI relates specifically to the supply of major compone...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> The Bloomfield Group<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519392<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Fleet Servicing & Accessories, Mining & Quarrying & Oil & Gas, Plant & Equipment - Disposal, Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
