<item><title>MSH SP26-501 Logan Ear Nose and Throat Expansion</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Metro South Health is seeking a suitably qualified Principal Contractor to deliver the Logan Hospital Ear, Nose and Throat (ENT) Expansion project under a Design and Construct contract. The project involves reviewing and completing the existing 80% detailed design, refurbishment and expansion of the current ENT Department into adjacent clinical space, construction works, services integration, commissioning and handover within a live hospital environment. The expansion will increase clinical capacity, improve patient access and support growing demand for ENT, Audiology and associated specialist services.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Metro South Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Aug/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP519348<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Eilish Tuohy Email: eilish.tuohy@health.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 3564 0323<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
