<item><title>Apex Park - Playground Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Greater Dandenong invites tenders from suitably qualified organisations for the design and construction of a renewed playground at Apex Park, Dandenong.<br /><br />The project includes concept design, detailed design, construction documentation, removal of existing playground elements, supply and installation of new play equipment, softfall surfacing, drainage, landscaping interface works and associated construction activities.<br /><br />Tenderers are required to provide a complete design-and-construct solution in accordance with the tender documentation, community consultation outcomes and project specifications.<br /><br />Location: Apex Park, Dandenong VIC.<br /><br />Closing Time: 2:00 PM Thursday 20 August 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Greater Dandenong<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518726<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Furniture & Furnishings, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
