<item><title>Aspire Estate Walking Connection</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Open Tender - Aspire Estate Walking Connection - Design and Construct <br /><br />Design and construction of a new DDA-compliant shared path and compliant lighting to provide an accessible connection between the Aspire Estate, Evanston South and the existing Gawler Bypass underpass. The project will deliver a safe and active transport link for pedestrians and cyclists, improving access to the broader footpath network and helping overcome the barrier posed by Main North Road. It also supports the objectives of Council’s Walking and Cycling Plan 2018–2028 and Gawler Integrated Transport Strategy 2024.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Gawler<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518697<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Brendan Eckert Email: brendan.eckert@gawler.sa.gov.au Tel: 08 8522 9272<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
