<item><title>ITT2551 Construction of Seawall and Stormwater Improvements - Diamond Head, Golden Beach</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council is seeking tenders for the Construction of Diamond Head Seawall Foreshore Protection Works and associated civil and landscaping works at Golden Beach. The site extends from the carpark opposite Raleigh St, to the south approximately 220m towards Roy St. <br /><br />The works to be performed under this Contract include the supply, installation and testing & commissioning of all materials, fabrication, plant, labour and the performance of all operations of whatever kind necessary for the complete and proper construction of the works to the standards and quality specified on drawings, and specifications, within the Contract documentation.<br /><br />Project includes:<br /><br />•	Seawall construction<br /><br />•	Civil construction <br /><br />•	Landscape construction<br /><br />•	Maintenance period <br /><br />This is a lump sum contract with an anticipated commencement in late October 2026, and a required completion by June 2027.<br /><br />A site information session will be held in acco...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 01/Sep/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518135<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 26]]></description>
