<item><title>ITT2553 Caloundra Resource Recovery Centre - Hardstand Rehabilitation</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council is looking to engage the services of a suitably qualified civil contractor to upgrade the Caloundra Resource Recovery Centre green waste hardstand area at Pierce Ave, Corbould Park, QLD.<br /><br />The successful contractor is to ensure the transfer station remains operational throughout construction.<br /><br />Communication and planning with the recovery centre will be essential for the successful delivery of this project. Respondents are encouraged to consider staging options that deliver an accelerated program of work, provided operational impacts (if any) are acceptable to Council.<br /><br />The scope of works includes, but is not limited to:<br /><br />•Supply and installation of all materials in accordance with the design drawings.<br /><br />•Implementation of traffic and pedestrian management, including delineation and control of work zones for the duration of construction.<br /><br />•Attendance at a pre-construction planning meeting and undertaking a survey of existing level...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Aug/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518131<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 20]]></description>
