<item><title>Ports North - 84-88 Cook Street External Refurbishment Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Ports North (The Principal) is a Queensland Government Owned Corporation (GOC) responsible for the development and management of the declared Ports of Cairns, Cape Flattery, Karumba, Mourilyan, Skardon River, Quintell Beach, Thursday Island,?Burketown?and Cooktown.<br /><br />The site of works is located at 84-88 Cook Street, Portsmith. The scope includes several elements of external refurbishment works, including external painting, installation of new handrails, installation of new concrete stairs, new roof sheeting and plumbing, roofing elements for repair and refurbishment, demolition of existing infrastructure and minor electrical works amongst other items.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Far North Queensland Ports Corporation Ltd<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Aug/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518256<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 22]]></description>
