<item><title>WT01-26/27 Construction of Water Main and Associated Ancillaries in Glenvale</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council (TRC) is looking for a contractor to construct watermain upgrades to improve drinking water supply in and around the Glenvale area. The Glenvale Reservoir, located on Skyline Drive, provides water to Glenvale (west of Boundary Street), Westbrook, and Wyreema Reservoir. It is filled from the Kynoch Zone via a reticulation network.<br /><br />TRC has identified two main issues affecting this water supply:<br /><br />• Insufficient pressure to fill the Glenvale Reservoir at the required flow rate.<br /><br />• High water velocities along Riethmuller Road and parts of Boundary Street, which cause pressure drops in other areas, - especially near Hursley Road - reducing supply to Westbrook and Wyreema.<br /><br />To address these issues, TRC's 2023 Water Supply Planning Report: Greater Western Toowoomba Water Supply Study recommends several upgrades. The scope of this contract includes two of these recommended improvements, as outlined below:<br /><br />• Augmentation GLW_21_6: A new DN25...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP518005<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 21]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=ab905dcc452c4bbb8edd075fc5b9b512s518005s786e232eacbb4e31b23c50bf234a0226s1611</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">ab905dcc452c4bbb8edd075fc5b9b512</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 05:27:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
