<item><title>Supply and Delivery of a Posi-Track Loader (or Equivalent), Attachments and Plant Trailer</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Balranald Shire Council invites quotations from suitably qualified suppliers for the supply and delivery of a current model Posi-Track Loader or approved equivalent complete with nominated attachments and a suitable transport trailer.<br /><br />The machine will be utilised for a variety of Council operational activities including:<br /><br />•	Infrastructure remediation works<br /><br />•	Scrub clearing<br /><br />•	Vegetation management<br /><br />•	Roadside maintenance<br /><br />•	Drainage and civil construction works<br /><br />•	General works and maintenance operations<br /><br />Council also invites suppliers to provide an optional trade-in valuation for Council's existing Challenger MT545 Tractor.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Balranald Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517937<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Quenten Graham Email: qgraham@balranald.nsw.gov.au Tel: 03 5020 1300<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
