<item><title>Supply and Delivery of a Replacement Tractor with Front End Loader</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Balranald Shire Council invites quotations from suitably qualified suppliers for the supply and delivery of a current model agricultural tractor with front end loader to replace Council's existing Challenger MT545 Tractor.<br /><br />The replacement machine is required to provide equal or improved performance, reliability, safety and operator comfort while meeting the operational requirements of Council's works and maintenance activities.<br /><br />Council also invites suppliers to provide an optional trade-in valuation for Council’s existing Challenger MT545 Front End Loader.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Balranald Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Aug/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP517930<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Quenten Graham Email: qgraham@balranald.nsw.gov.au Tel: 03 5020 1300<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
