<item><title>CN-26497 FTZD5303 87A Dawson Developmental Road (Springsure–Tambo)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> 87A Dawson Developmental Road (Springsure–Tambo) Transport Infrastructure Contract - Construction Only. <br /><br />The works comprise the pavement construction, paving and sealing of approximately 3.8 km of the Fitzroy Developmental Road between Bauhinia and Duaringa:<br /><br />Section 1- Ch 60.773 - 63.150km<br /><br />Section 2- Ch 64.820 - 66.200km<br /><br />Construction of a fully sealed two-lane carriageway to a width of 8.0 m and tie-in to previously sealed sections.<br /><br />Pavement construction (subgrade, subbase,base, seal)<br /><br />Local widening and intersection improvements tocater for turning movements and property accesses.<br /><br />Replacement or extension of existing culverts as required.<br /><br />Associated drainage works to manage stormwater runoff in accordance with TMR specifications.<br /><br />Associated traffic management, environmental controls, and finishing works<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-Central Qld<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Aug/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP516511<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
